        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mash the bananas thoroughly with a fork until no large lumps remain. A few small pieces are fine but the batter should be mostly smooth. Do not use a blender -- hand mashing gives the right texture. Mix the batter by hand; over-mixing by machine can make the loaf tough."
          }
        ]
      },
